ass=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">公立</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こうりつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">公立</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75434\">その<ruby>当時<rp>(</rp><rt>とうじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、どこの<ruby>公立<rp>(</rp><rt>こうりつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>学校<rp>(</rp><rt>がっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にもネイティブの<ruby>英語<rp>(</rp><rt>えいご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>先生<rp>(</rp><rt>せんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>などいませんでした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">当时没有任何以英语为母语的人在公立学校任教。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/811792\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">効率</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こうりつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">效率</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>作業<rp>(</rp><rt>さぎょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>効率<rp>(</rp><rt>こうりつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>上<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>げる<ruby>方法<rp>(</rp><rt>ほうほう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>考<rp>(</rp><rt>かんが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>える。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">思考提高作业效率的方法。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">小柄</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こがら</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">身材矮小；娇小玲珑；小花纹；细图案</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"139910\"><ruby>息子<rp>(</rp><rt>むすこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>年<rp>(</rp><rt>とし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>割<rp>(</rp><rt>わり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>小柄<rp>(</rp><rt>こがら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">儿子年龄较小。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">小切手</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こぎって</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">支票</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221176\">この<ruby>小切手<rp>(</rp><rt>こぎって</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>現金<rp>(</rp><rt>げんきん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にしてくれますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你能把这支票拿到现金吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">国産</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こくさん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">国产；国内生产；日本产</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76689\">しかし、<ruby>国産<rp>(</rp><rt>こくさん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ワインといっても、<ruby>国内<rp>(</rp><rt>こくない</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>瓶詰<rp>(</rp><rt>びんづ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めされたものは<ruby>全<rp>(</rp><rt>すべ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>て<ruby>国産<rp>(</rp><rt>こくさん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ワインとなります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">但是,即使是国内葡萄酒,在国内包装的所有瓶子都是国内葡萄酒。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">国定</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こくてい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">国家规定的；国定的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">国土</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こくど</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">国土；领土；疆域；领域</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230172\">アメリカは<ruby>国土<rp>(</rp><rt>こくど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>広<rp>(</rp><rt>ひろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く、<ruby>人々<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとびと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はよく<ruby>移動<rp>(</rp><rt>いどう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">美国有广阔的土地,人们经常移动。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">告白</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こくはく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">坦白；供认；认罪；表白（爱意）；示爱；表明信仰；信仰告白；忏悔；告解</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"105557\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>好<rp>(</rp><rt>す</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きになったと<ruby>告白<rp>(</rp><rt>こくはく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他承认自己喜欢我。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">国防</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こくぼう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">国防；国家防卫</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"173033\"><ruby>国防<rp>(</rp><rt>こくぼう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のため<ruby>大<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きな<ruby>額<rp>(</rp><rt>がく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>計上<rp>(</rp><rt>けいじょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">为国防付出了巨额资金。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">国有</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こくゆう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">国有；国家所有；政府所有</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">国連</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こくれん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">联合国；联合国（UN）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"173007\"><ruby>国連<rp>(</rp><rt>こくれん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>国際問題<rp>(</rp><rt>こくさいもんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>扱<rp>(</rp><rt>あつか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>うだろう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">联合国将处理国际问题。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">漕ぐ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">こぐ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">划桨；摇桨；划船；踩踏；蹬踏（自行车等）；荡（秋千）；操作（手动泵）；穿过；推进（灌木丛、深雪等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"96565\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>池<rp>(</rp><rt>いけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でボートを<ruby>漕<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いでいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他们在池子里游船。</span></div></li>"]